OpenROAD's detailed-router checker (drt::check_drc, one thread), patched with fprintf trace lines at
the points listed in the test file, run on the synthetic fixtures in the parent directory with the
rules written WITHOUT SAMEMASK (the reference drops the SAMEMASK forms).

